&lt;p&gt;A verified profile can be one consideration, but guests should not rely on verification alone.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews and Account Reputation
Reviews can provide useful information about previous experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, reviews should be considered in context.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Users can examine:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The number of reviews.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How recent the reviews are.&lt;/p&gt;

