&lt;p&gt;Verification does not mean an account is permanently protected from review.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If an account requires attention, the legitimate account holder should follow the official resolution process.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoiding Misleading Claims About Verified Accounts
People researching Buy Verified Airbnb Accounts may encounter advertisements making strong promises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Claims such as “guaranteed bookings,” “permanent trust,” “unlimited reservations,” or “special ranking” should be treated carefully.&lt;/p&gt;

