&lt;p&gt;Sharing passwords broadly can increase security risks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Whenever supported, businesses should use appropriate account-access mechanisms instead of casually distributing credentials.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Information and Account Security
Travel accounts can reveal information such as destinations, booking dates, accommodation details, and communication history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This information can be sensitive.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Users should therefore avoid posting unnecessary booking information publicly.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;They should also be cautious when accessing their accounts from public computers or unsecured networks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What Makes an Airbnb Profile Established?
An established profile can have a longer history of legitimate activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

